      "content": "okay, that makes sense. thank you for the actual help. \n\ni'll try setting up that miscellaneous account. i'm just a bit paranoid because some of these little amounts are so random—like a $4.12 charge here or a $2.89 charge there—and they don't even have names on the bank statement, just \"debit.\" it's like they're just... vanishing into thin air or being snatched away before i can even see what they are. \n\nis there any other way for a business to audit these? like, how do i make sure i'm not actually losing money to some kind of fraud or hidden fees that are just being slipped through the cracks? i want to make sure nothing is being taken from my account without me knowing.",
